    "text": "As the President of the United States, I believe that tax filing is not only a matter of fairness and responsibility but also a critical step in ensuring that every citizen, regardless of their income level, has the opportunity to contribute to the nation's prosperity. It is essential that we work together to simplify the process, ensure that all taxpayers are treated with dignity and respect, and that the system is transparent and equitable. We must also recognize that the quality of our tax filing process directly impacts the integrity of our financial system, and that every taxpayer, including those who may be in a position of vulnerability, deserves a fair and efficient way to file their taxes. Let us continue to prioritize the quality and accuracy of tax filings, and ensure that the letter Q is not just a part of the process, but a symbol of our commitment to excellence, integrity, and the people we serve.",
